NativeTypeLambdaTypeAppWildcard.hs:7:28: error: [GHC-27185]
    A type lambda needs a supported position in a top-level type synonym, the right-hand side of a type family equation, a value signature, an expression type annotation, a complete visible type argument, or an ordinary constructor field.
    A local signature can use a type lambda during ordinary compilation when GHC can copy the kinds of its captures, or infer their kinds and check the body in that scope.

